  entryLines:
  - text: "Hele\u010Fme se, kl\xED\u010D!"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Ten nejsp\xED\u0161 otev\xEDr\xE1 ty dve\u0159e na konci m\xEDstnosti. "
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "A kouk\xE1m \u017Ee z t\u011Bch d\u011Bt\xED padaj\xED i n\u011Bjak\xE9
      ty v\xED\u010Dka, ty se ur\u010Dit\u011B vyplat\xED sb\xEDrat. V na\u0161em
      pivovaru se n\xE1m budou hodit!"
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
